      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "At that time, Englevale operated four grain elevators, one of which burned down in 1915, leaving three to serve the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        11,
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
