      ],
      "source": "https://ransomcountynd.net/englevale-2/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A horse‑drawn freight line linked Englevale to Fort Ransom, operated by Avery of Fort Ransom.",
